== Description ==
The [[:Category:Tier_2_Pets|Tier 2]] version of {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Interrogator}}. Increases Incantation spells duration and efficiency of Evocation spells and profits with amount of unlocked achievements.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] each second depending on the amount of currently active spells.

== Pet Abilities ==

Multiplies Evocation efficiency by:
<br><math>P \times L^{1.125} \times 25 + 1</math>


Multiplies Incantation duration by:
<br><math>log_{10}(L^{2} \times P) \times (1 + \frac{L}{500}) \times 0.025 + 1</math>


Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>A^{0.65} \times \left( P^{0.15} \times \frac{L}{50} + 1 \right) \times 0.25 + 1</math>


where:
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power} </math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level} </math>
* <math>A = \text{Achievements Unlocked} </math>

== Experience Gain ==
Gains experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>\left( S^3 \times 10 + F \right) \times M  </math>

where:
* <math>S = \text{Active Spells} </math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus} </math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier} </math>

